  "question": {
    "text": "The total number of stereoisomers for the complex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Cr</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>ox</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>ClBr</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo></mrow></msup></math> (where ox = oxalate) is"
  },
