  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The complex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>Cr</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>ox</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>ClBr</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;exhibits two geometrical isomers. Among these isomers Cis-isomer is optically active.&nbsp; Hence, the total number of stereoisomers for the given complex is 3.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0103_0d50831fedab.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 239px;\" /></p>"
  }
